    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-4d7f374c304579037c1c0063",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "极点和零点的位置不必低于必要限度，因为滞后环节引入的附加系统根将与校正零点处于同一频率范围，并会对输出响应（尤其是对扰动输入的响应）产生一定影响。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The pole and zero are located no lower than necessary because the additional system root introduced by the lag will be in the same frequency range as the compensation zero and will have some effect on the output response, especially the response to disturbance inputs.",
